        "x1": 0.7035653594771242,
        "y1": 0.4871212121212122
      },
      "text": "  ≤ 8c0n3.5+˜ǫ.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2964705882352941,
        "y0": 0.4209646464646465,
        "x1": 0.3232450980392157,
        "y1": 0.4622727272727273
      },
      "text": "E ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.42627450980392156,
        "y0": 0.4295176767676767,
        "x1": 0.590248366013072,
        "y1": 0.4718598484848485
      },
      "text": "1 (|λj − λi| + n−1.5−ǫ˜)2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4262549019607843,
        "y0": 0.44546969696969696,
        "x1": 0.591156862745098,
        "y1": 0.44607575757575757
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.31137254901960787,
        "y0": 0.4458131313131313,
        "x1": 0.3232450980392157,
        "y1": 0.4871212121212122
      },
      "text": "",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.32313725490196077,
        "y0": 0.4591199494949495,
        "x1": 0.42201470588235296,
        "y1": 0.4762777777777778
      },
      "text": "i =j∈[n]:|i−j|≤2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14705882352941177,
        "y0": 0.4779078282828283,
        "x1": 0.622014705882353,
        "y1": 0.5036780303030304
      },
      "text": "Now, by the Markov’s inequality, with probability 1 − n−ǫ˜, we get",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4152941176470588,
        "y0": 0.5001237373737374,
        "x1": 0.6876813725490196,
        "y1": 0.5424659090909091
      },
      "text": "1 (|λj − λi| + n−1.5−ǫ˜)2 ≤ 8c0n3.5+2˜ǫ.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.41527450980392155,
        "y0": 0.5160757575757576,
        "x1": 0.5801764705882353,
        "y1": 0.5166818181818182
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.31235294117647056,
        "y0": 0.5297247474747475,
        "x1": 0.41123039215686275,
        "y1": 0.5468825757575757
      },
      "text": "i =j∈[n]:|i−j|≤2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14705882352941177,
        "y0": 0.5485126262626263,
        "x1": 0.8528872549019607,
        "y1": 0.5811843434343434
      },
      "text": "As mini∈[n−1] |λi+1 − λi| ≥ n−1.5−ǫ˜ with probability 1 − o(1) by (Feng et al., 2019, Corollary 1), we get",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3080392156862745,
        "y0": 0.5878510101010102,
        "x1": 0.40561601307189543,
        "y1": 0.6301931818181818
      },
      "text": "1 (λj − λi)2 ≤",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5137254901960784,
        "y0": 0.5878522727272728,
        "x1": 0.8527990196078431,
        "y1": 0.6301931818181818
      },
      "text": "4 (|λj − λi| + n−1.5−ǫ˜)2 ≤ 32c0n3.5+2˜ǫ. (9)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.30801960784313726,
        "y0": 0.6036515151515152,
        "x1": 0.38507843137254905,
        "y1": 0.6042575757575758
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5137058823529411,
        "y0": 0.6036515151515152,
        "x1": 0.6786078431372549,
        "y1": 0.6042575757575758
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20490196078431375,
        "y0": 0.617300505050505,
        "x1": 0.3037794117647059,
        "y1": 0.6344583333333333
      },
      "text": "i =j∈[n]:|i−j|≤2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.41058823529411764,
        "y0": 0.6173017676767677,
        "x1": 0.5094656862745098,
        "y1": 0.634459595959596
      },
      "text": "i =j∈[n]:|i−j|≤2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14705882352941177,
        "y0": 0.6369419191919192,
        "x1": 0.8527990196078431,
        "y1": 0.6861527777777778
      },
      "text": "Now, we focus on bounding the terms for which |i − j| ≥ 3. By (Nguyen et al., 2017, Corollary 2.5) and union bound, we have mini∈[n−3] |λi+3 − λi| ≤ n−6/5−ǫ/˜ 5 with probability 1 − c0n−ǫ˜ for some c0 > 0. Using this bound, we get",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7617647058823529,
        "y0": 0.6915441919191919,
        "x1": 0.7794640522875816,
        "y1": 0.7087020202020202
      },
      "text": "−2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7031372549019608,
        "y0": 0.6954267676767676,
        "x1": 0.7492516339869281,
        "y1": 0.7279886363636363
      },
      "text": "|j − i| 3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4205882352941176,
        "y0": 0.6954267676767676,
        "x1": 0.5908366013071895,
        "y1": 0.7377689393939394
      },
      "text": "1 mini∈[n−3](λi+3 − λi)2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.31607843137254904,
        "y0": 0.6954267676767676,
        "x1": 0.41365522875816996,
        "y1": 0.7377689393939394
      },
      "text": "1 (λi − λj)2 ≤",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3160588235294118,
        "y0": 0.7113787878787878,
        "x1": 0.3931176470588235,
        "y1": 0.7119848484848486
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.42056862745098034,
        "y0": 0.7113787878787878,
        "x1": 0.5917450980392157,
        "y1": 0.7119848484848486
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7031176470588235,
        "y0": 0.7113787878787878,
        "x1": 0.7493921568627451,
        "y1": 0.7119848484848486
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5966666666666667,
        "y0": 0.7250277777777778,
        "x1": 0.6886797385620915,
        "y1": 0.7421868686868687
      },
      "text": "i,j∈[n]:|i−j|≥3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.21980392156862746,
        "y0": 0.7250290404040405,
        "x1": 0.3118186274509804,
        "y1": 0.7421868686868687
      },
      "text": "i,j∈[n]:|i−j|≥3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5154901960784314,
        "y0": 0.7395732323232322,
        "x1": 0.5238774509803922,
        "y1": 0.7496376262626263
      },
      "text": "n",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5374509803921569,
        "y0": 0.7446691919191919,
        "x1": 0.676702614379085,
        "y1": 0.7776174242424242
      },
      "text": "1 i2 ≤ π2n17/5+2˜ǫ/5.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3998039215686275,
        "y0": 0.7510883838383838,
        "x1": 0.5029934640522876,
        "y1": 0.7776174242424242
      },
      "text": "≤ 6n17/5+2˜ǫ/5",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5374313725490196,
        "y0": 0.7606212121212121,
        "x1": 0.5513529411764706,
        "y1": 0.7612272727272728
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5084313725490196,
        "y0": 0.7733623737373737,
        "x1": 0.5308366013071896,
        "y1": 0.783425505050505
      },
      "text": "i=1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14705882352941177,
        "y0": 0.7904267676767677,
        "x1": 0.716328431372549,
        "y1": 0.8139810606060606
      },
      "text": "Now, combining the above inequality with (9), we get with probability 1 − o(1)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3423529411764706,
        "y0": 0.8108813131313131,
        "x1": 0.7284673202614379,
        "y1": 0.8532234848484849
      },
      "text": "1 (λj − λi)2 ≤ 32c0n3.5+2˜ǫ + π2n17/5+2˜ǫ/5 ≤ n3.5+3˜ǫ,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3423333333333333,
        "y0": 0.8268333333333333,
        "x1": 0.4193921568627451,
        "y1": 0.8274393939393939
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27156862745098037,
        "y0": 0.8404823232323233,
        "x1": 0.33715522875816994,
        "y1": 0.8576401515151515
      },
      "text": "i,j∈[n]:i =j",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14705882352941177,
        "y0": 0.8599722222222222,
        "x1": 0.7770049019607843,
        "y1": 0.8737462121212121
      },
      "text": "where the last inequality holds for n large enough. Picking ˜ǫ = ǫ/6 completes the proof.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4917647058823529,
        "y0": 0.9164962121212121,
        "x1": 0.5081388888888889,
        "y1": 0.9278939393939394
      },
      "text": "16",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
